{{Dialogue Start}}
;(По прибытии на место)

;(По прибытии на место)
----
:'''Natasha:''' Mom!
:'''Vanessa:''' Nat... Nat! Is that you? Oh come here, my darling...
:{{Black Screen|Natasha and her adoptive mother share a warm embrace...}}
:'''Natasha:''' It's been too long, mom... too long.
:'''Natasha:''' Sorry, I don't usually get this emotional... How have you been, Mr. Oswell? Thank you so much for taking care of my parents these last ten years.
:'''Butler Oswell:''' I'm doing fine, Miss Natasha, just fine... Look at you! You've blossomed into a fine young woman. Such a pity that your father...
:'''Natasha:''' ...Dad? I was wondering where he is. Is he...
:'''Natasha:''' Ah...
:'''Vanessa:''' ...It was three years ago, Nat. No need to be sad... he passed away very peacefully.
:'''Natasha:''' ...
:'''Natasha:''' I'm so sorry mom... I'm so sorry. For ten years, I left you both in the Overworld. Mr. Oswell, I'm sorry you had to bear all this weight.
:'''Butler Oswell:''' Don't be, my dear... It is my honor to look after your parents.
:'''Vanessa:''' It's not your fault that they sealed off the passage between the surface and the underground. Don't be so harsh on yourself, daughter.
:'''Natasha:''' ...
:'''Natasha:''' Mom... I have so much to say to you, but there's an urgent matter that needs your help.
:'''Natasha:''' I apologize. I wish this were a happier reunion... but there are too many suffering with sickness in the Underworld. You're the only person I can go to for help.
:'''Vanessa:''' There's no need to apologize, my child... I've heard of your deeds down there and I know you've saved many lives. Your father... he would be proud of you.
:'''Vanessa:''' We have many connections in the medical academy. No matter what you need, be it medicine or data, I should be able to get it for you.
:'''Vanessa:''' Be the doctor you always were, Nat. We have all the time in the world to catch up later...
:{{Black Screen|You discuss the details about the medicine supply work in the Underworld...}}
:'''Natasha:''' ...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} She's a great mother.
::'''Natasha:''' She's always been there for me.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I'm sorry about your father...
::'''Natasha:''' It's alright, (Trailblazer). I was prepared... Although it still hurts to hear it from mom.
:'''Natasha:''' With her help, we'll be able to ease the Underworld's medical supply shortage. That's good news for patients who'd lost hope.
:'''Natasha:''' I really wish I could spend the whole day talking to her about the old days. But sadly now is not the time.
:'''Natasha:''' Let's head back to the Underworld, (Trailblazer). We need to spread the good news.
:'''Butler Oswell:''' Miss Natasha! One moment please!
:<!--1.5-second delay-->
----
{{Dialogue End}}

