----
:'''Silvermane Guard Sentry:''' ...Citizens? Outside the walls? Hey, you two, stop right there!
:'''Natasha:''' That's a Silvermane Guard. Is he yelling at us?
:'''Natasha:''' Ah, I'd almost forgotten... No one can leave Belobog without authorization. Looks like we need to talk our way out of this, (Trailblazer).
:{{Black Screen|You explain your identity and purpose to the patrolling Silvermane Guard.}}
:'''Sentry Leader:''' I can't say you sound suspicious, but... I can't just take your word for it either...
:'''Silvermane Guard Sentry:''' Captain, look at her necklace... Maybe she's telling the truth.
:'''Sentry Leader:''' ...!
:'''Sentry Leader:''' It's... the same as Dr. Vache's.
:'''Natasha:''' My brother does wear an identical necklace... Do you know him?
:'''Sentry Leader:''' Are you really his sister? Dr. Vache saved a lot of my soldiers!
:'''Natasha:''' Saved... your soldiers?
:'''Sentry Leader:''' Yes. Take a look at the guards patrolling outside the city. All of them are risking their lives.
:'''Sentry Leader:''' Aside from the monster-related casualties, we lose men to frostbite every year.
:'''Sentry Leader:''' But thanks to the medicine the doctor leaves us, my soldiers are able to withstand the cold. They can make camps in the Snow Plains as footholds for our patrols... If it weren't for the doctor, we would have long since frozen to death.
:'''Natasha:''' Medicine... Blizzard Immunity...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Where is Vache now?
::'''Sentry Leader:''' ...We don't know.
::'''Sentry Leader:''' Doctor Vache is... elusive. My squad only met him once, and he didn't seem like the talkative type. He leaves the medicine at specific locations and our patrols go there to collect it.
::'''Sentry Leader:''' The medicine is extremely potent &mdash; a small vial can keep someone warm for a week.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Is there enough for all of you?
::'''Sentry Leader:''' The medicine is extremely potent &mdash; a small vial can keep someone warm for a week. We have over half our stock left.
::'''Sentry Leader:''' Doctor Vache is... elusive. My squad only met him once, and he didn't seem like the talkative type. He leaves the medicine at specific locations and our patrols go there to collect it.
:'''Sentry Leader:''' Speaking of the doctor, it's been a long time since we last saw him... at least two or three years. I hope he's alive and well...
:'''Natasha:''' So he really did have a breakthrough in the Snow Plains...
:'''Natasha:''' Did the medicine have any side effects for you?
:'''Sentry Leader:''' ...Side effects? Not that I know of. If there were a problem, it'd be that we couldn't go back to the city until the effect had worn off...
:'''Sentry Leader:''' ...because the city would be too hot for us. We'd break a sweat just sitting idle, haha.
:'''Natasha:''' ...
:'''Natasha:''' Thanks for the information. We're planning to head deeper into the Snow Plains to find my brother.
:'''Sentry Leader:''' ...Seems like you've made up your mind. I'd really like to send some of my men with you, but we can't leave our posts.
:'''Sentry Leader:''' Here, take this medicine. If what you two told me is true, I'm sure you're more than capable of handling yourselves out there.
:'''Natasha:''' Thank you, captain. We'll take it with us.
